usage: Replay a generated RoboLab task with a privileged Cartesian grasp/place probe.

Run inside the RoboLab Sim environment with the gujie rollout helpers on PYTHONPATH.
Every attempted reset has a separate trace, video and summary.

       [-h] --task TASK --object OBJECT --target TARGET --seeds SEEDS
       [SEEDS ...] [--grasp-yaw GRASP_YAW] [--grasp-height GRASP_HEIGHT] --out
       OUT
Replay a generated RoboLab task with a privileged Cartesian grasp/place probe.

Run inside the RoboLab Sim environment with the gujie rollout helpers on PYTHONPATH.
Every attempted reset has a separate trace, video and summary.
: error: probe object and target must match the registered task roles
